      },
      "text": "HOHENBERG-KOHN THEOREM (1964):\n    1. Ground-state electron density ρ(r) uniquely determines\n       all ground-state properties (energy, geometry, etc.)\n    2. Variational principle: E[ρ] ≥ E_ground for any trial ρ"
    },
