      },
      "text": "```\n  LEVEL 1 — LDA (Local Density Approximation):\n    E_xc = ∫ ε_xc(ρ(r)) ρ(r) d³r\n    Only depends on local density. Works surprisingly well for metals.\n    Overbinds molecules (~1 eV error)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-COMPUTATIONAL-MATERIALS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "09-COMPUTATIONAL-MATERIALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:materials:09-computational-materials, git-history:materials:09-computational-materials]",
        "canonical_path": "materials/09-COMPUTATIONAL-MATERIALS.md",
