        "root_concepts": "[computational, materials]",
        "section": "materials",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computational Materials Science",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LEVEL 2 — GGA (Generalized Gradient Approximation):\n    E_xc = ∫ ε_xc(ρ, ∇ρ) d³r\n    PBE (Perdew-Burke-Ernzerhof): workhorse for solids\n    BLYP, B3LYP: workhorse for chemistry"
    },
    {
