        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computational Materials Science",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LEVEL 3 — Meta-GGA:\n    Also uses kinetic energy density τ(r) = Σ |∇φᵢ|²/2\n    SCAN functional: satisfies all 17 known exact constraints"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-COMPUTATIONAL-MATERIALS.md#015",
      "path": [
