      },
      "text": "LEVEL 4 — Hybrid (HF + DFT):\n    E_xc = α E_x^HF + (1-α) E_x^DFT + E_c^DFT\n    B3LYP (α=0.2): chemistry standard, good bandgaps\n    HSE06: screened hybrid for solids (O(N) scaling)"
